   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Touch Me Part I'm Going to Scream (Part 1)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Knot Comes Loose**: back after 21 archived shows (596 days) [4]\n- **Smoking to Shooting**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2008-08-29..peluso.akg.16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 131 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer asks about a jazz tune the band has been playing before they come on during this tour [2]\n- The intro music played before the band starts is Moondog's Birds' Lament [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2008-08-29..peluso.akg.16**: taped by DolphinSmile; transferred by DolphinSmile; source: 4 Mic matrix, AKG 452's+Peluso Cards>8 channel Yamaha Mixer>Edirol R9 [1]",
